 "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far? For every hour, about a liter and a half to two liters. More on hot days and less on cool ones. Plan a little ahead and take a bottle and bottle cage out on the ride, rather than running low. A banana or sandwich in your bag is nice, but real food in your stomach is better. Eating little and often is the key. You can, but it' not ideal. Your body gets bit of a hit, and you might feel a bit light headed.",
